  "goodToKnow": "Die Spirituose is a spirit or liquor, mostly plural: Wein und Spirituosen. In the EU, a Spirituose must have at least 15 percent alcohol. German classics include Korn, fruit brandies (Obstler, Kirschwasser from the Black Forest) and herbal liqueurs (Kräuterlikör). Spirits are sold only to adults over 18. Colloquially: der Schnaps. Plural: die Spirituosen."
